abstract: >-
  Reproducible machine-learning baseline for network intrusion detection using
  UNSW-NB15, comparing Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and XGBoost under
  leakage-aware preprocessing, FPR-constrained threshold selection, and a
  non-IID weighted-FedAvg federated-learning experiment.
